  "content": "<h2>Zegarn PvP 资源包</h2><p>极简PvP资源包，专注于<strong>清晰、舒适且干净</strong>的视觉效果。</p><p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpvp-zegarn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Modrinth 上获取更快的更新</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252f7Km7EkeKcx7sAbDv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">反馈错误或提出建议</a></span></p><h2>✦ 更新日志</h2><p><strong>1.3.4</strong></p><ul>\n<li>新图标</li>\n<li>新全景菜单 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c5ac2780a357a5679a1033cf11852c0f5426512_0.webp\" alt=\"全景图\"></li>\n</ul><p><strong>1.3.3</strong></p><ul>\n<li>新物品高亮效果</li>\n<li>新提示背景</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 特色</h2><p><strong>视觉</strong></p><ul>\n<li>简洁极简的HUD</li>\n<li>深色UI主题</li>\n<li>自定义准星</li>\n<li>自定义天空</li>\n<li>自定义主菜单和全景</li>\n</ul><p><strong>纹理</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新设计的盔甲、物品和方块</li>\n<li>重新设计的不死图腾</li>\n<li>更新末影水晶</li>\n<li>重新设计盾牌纹理</li>\n<li>更新细雪纹理</li>\n<li>更小的火焰</li>\n</ul><p><strong>游戏性改进</strong></p><ul>\n<li>作物生长指示器</li>\n<li>生命和饥饿条重新上色</li>\n<li>红石微调</li>\n</ul><p><strong>音效</strong></p><ul>\n<li>自定义音效（已更新和优化）</li>\n</ul><p><strong>界面 / GUI</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新设计物品栏</li>\n<li>改进提示和物品高亮</li>\n<li>更干净的界面元素</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 要求</h2><p><strong>天空效果（Forge）：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p><p><strong>天空效果（Fabric）：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或者</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 俄文版本</h2><h2>✦ 特色</h2><p><strong>视觉效果</strong></p><ul>\n<li>干净极简的HUD</li>\n<li>深色界面主题</li>\n<li>自定义准星</li>\n<li>自定义天空</li>\n<li>自定义主菜单和全景图</li>\n</ul><p><strong>纹理</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新设计的盔甲、物品和方块</li>\n<li>重新设计的不死图腾</li>\n<li>更新末影水晶</li>\n<li>重新设计盾牌纹理</li>\n<li>更新细雪纹理</li>\n<li>更小火焰</li>\n</ul><p><strong>游戏改进</strong></p><ul>\n<li>作物生长指示器</li>\n<li>重新上色的生命值和饥饿值</li>\n<li>红石微调改进</li>\n</ul><p><strong>音效</strong></p><ul>\n<li>自定义音效（已更新和优化）</li>\n</ul><p><strong>界面 / GUI</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新设计物品栏</li>\n<li>改进提示和物品高亮效果</li>\n<li>更简洁的界面元素</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 要求</h2><p><strong>天空（Forge）：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p><p><strong>天空（Fabric）：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或者</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>✦ 鸣谢</h2><p>部分方块纹理基于：<span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones</a></span></p>",
